      "cooked": "<p>Is there a way to see the losing title cards, including the ones from the environment?&nbsp;It would nice to see them somewhere. Also, I recall there being music for losing scenarios based on Wagner Mars Base, and Silver Gulch. Is there a way we can listen to these in the game itself? I know we can listen to the villain's victory music on their page, but no way to listen to the others. It would just be cool to see and hear all of this content, since the music and art are outstanding.&nbsp;</p>",
